{"id":"afeb22707a474889","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections.md","title":"Definition II.6 Étale Maps and Local Sections","display":"Definition II.6 Étale Maps and Local Sections","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections","aliases":["14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections"],"display":"Definition II.6 Étale Maps and Local Sections","depends_on":["[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]"],"source_location":"II.6, printed 88; DjVu 50","source_evidence":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition II.6 Étale Maps and Local Sections"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"II.6, printed 88; DjVu 50"},{"key":"source_evidence","html":"附件中的原稿来源记录；本次修订不构成对相应原书或 OCR 的读取证明。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；空间载体、截面值与指标集均取于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span>，有关范畴和函子集合在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 中处理。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,E)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" href=\"?note=f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0\" title=\"14-df-topological-sheaf\">14-df-topological-sheaf</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:E\\to X\">\\(p:E\\to X\\)</span>。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq E\">\\(A\\subseteq E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma|_A=\\{A\\cap W:W\\in\\sigma\\}\">\\(\\sigma|_A=\\{A\\cap W:W\\in\\sigma\\}\\)</span>；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq X\">\\(B\\subseteq X\\)</span> 同理。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p[W]\">\\(p[W]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p^{-1}[U]\">\\(p^{-1}[U]\\)</span> 分别表示函数像与逆像。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cont}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cont}\\)</span> 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Etale}\">\\(\\mathrm{Etale}\\)</span> 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}\\)</span> 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sec}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sec}\\)</span> 是本条 Assertion 定义的新映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cont}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\iff p\\in X^E\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(p^{-1}[U]\\in\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cont}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\iff p\\in X^E\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(p^{-1}[U]\\in\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathrm{Cont}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\land p[E]=X\\land\\forall e,e&#39;\\in E\\;(p(e)=p(e&#39;)\\Rightarrow e=e&#39;)\\land\\forall W\\in\\sigma\\;(p[W]\\in\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Homeo}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathrm{Cont}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\land p[E]=X\\land\\forall e,e&#39;\\in E\\;(p(e)=p(e&#39;)\\Rightarrow e=e&#39;)\\land\\forall W\\in\\sigma\\;(p[W]\\in\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Etale}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathrm{Cont}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;\\exists W\\in\\sigma\\;\\bigl(e\\in W\\land p[W]\\in\\tau\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}(p|_W;W,\\sigma|_W;p[W],\\tau|_{p[W]})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Etale}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathrm{Cont}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;\\exists W\\in\\sigma\\;\\bigl(e\\in W\\land p[W]\\in\\tau\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}(p|_W;W,\\sigma|_W;p[W],\\tau|_{p[W]})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)=\\{s\\in E^U:\\mathrm{Cont}(s;U,\\tau|_U;E,\\sigma)\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;(p(s(x))=x)\\}\\qquad(U\\in\\tau).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)=\\{s\\in E^U:\\mathrm{Cont}(s;U,\\tau|_U;E,\\sigma)\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;(p(s(x))=x)\\}\\qquad(U\\in\\tau).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\sigma|_A:=\\{A\\cap W\\mid W\\in\\sigma\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq E),\\qquad\\tau|_B:=\\{B\\cap U\\mid U\\in\\tau\\}\\quad(B\\subseteq X).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\sigma|_A:=\\{A\\cap W\\mid W\\in\\sigma\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq E),\\qquad\\tau|_B:=\\{B\\cap U\\mid U\\in\\tau\\}\\quad(B\\subseteq X).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\otimes\\sigma:=\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{U\\times W\\mid U\\in\\tau,\\ W\\in\\sigma\\}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\tau\\otimes\\sigma:=\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{U\\times W\\mid U\\in\\tau,\\ W\\in\\sigma\\}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书的 étale = 局部同胚，未附加总空间 Hausdorff 或映射满射的要求。截面只在一个开集上定义，因而空纤维和非满射局部同胚都允许。Homeo 的开放性与连续双射一起精确保证逆函数连续。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-topological-sheaf]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-topological-sheaf","status":"resolved","id":"f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)$、$\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,E)$（see [[14-df-topological-sheaf]]），$p:E\\to X$。对 $A\\subseteq E$，$\\sigma|_A=\\{A\\cap W:W\\in\\sigma\\}$；对 $B\\subseteq X$ 同理。$p[W]$、$p^{-1}[U]$ 分别表示函数像与逆像。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\sigma,E)","display":false},{"tex":"p:E\\to X","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq E","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma|_A=\\{A\\cap W:W\\in\\sigma\\}","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"p[W]","display":false},{"tex":"p^{-1}[U]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cont}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Etale}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cont}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\iff p\\in X^E\\land\\forall U\\in\\tau\\;(p^{-1}[U]\\in\\sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathrm{Cont}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\land p[E]=X\\land\\forall e,e'\\in E\\;(p(e)=p(e')\\Rightarrow e=e')\\land\\forall W\\in\\sigma\\;(p[W]\\in\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Etale}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\iff\\mathrm{Cont}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)\\land\\forall e\\in E\\;\\exists W\\in\\sigma\\;\\bigl(e\\in W\\land p[W]\\in\\tau\\land\\mathrm{Homeo}(p|_W;W,\\sigma|_W;p[W],\\tau|_{p[W]})\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)=\\{s\\in E^U:\\mathrm{Cont}(s;U,\\tau|_U;E,\\sigma)\\land\\forall x\\in U\\;(p(s(x))=x)\\}\\qquad(U\\in\\tau).","display":true},{"tex":"\\sigma|_A:=\\{A\\cap W\\mid W\\in\\sigma\\}\\quad(A\\subseteq E),\\qquad\\tau|_B:=\\{B\\cap U\\mid U\\in\\tau\\}\\quad(B\\subseteq X).","display":true},{"tex":"\\tau\\otimes\\sigma:=\\left\\{\\bigcup\\mathcal A\\ \\middle|\\ \\mathcal A\\subseteq\\{U\\times W\\mid U\\in\\tau,\\ W\\in\\sigma\\}\\right\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":2321,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections|Definition II.6 Étale Maps and Local Sections]]"},{"id":"24c837c0a0986f5c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ead2b5b1b3a20ecd","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cover}$ 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词。 $\\mathrm{Homeo}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{LocConst}$ 是本条 Assertion 定义的新谓词。 $\\mathrm{Nat}$ 沿用 [[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{id}_A$ 表示集合或函子 $A$ 的恒等映射。"},{"id":"08a9469876bddf9f","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cont}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{germ}$ 沿用 [[14-df-germs-and-stalks]] 中的精确签名。"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]"},{"id":"b12a36bd580ec12e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)$ 连续；$F$ 是 $X$ 上的层，$G$ 也是 $X$ 上的层，$h:F\\to G$ 为自然变换；另设 $g:(Y,\\nu)\\to(Z,\\xi)$ 连续。记号见 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]、[[14-thm-sheaf-of-continuous-sections]]。对象和态射分量取 $V\\in\\nu$，限制公式取 $V,W\\in\\nu$ 且 $W\\subseteq V$；所写底层限制函数按 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 包装为集合箭头。"},{"id":"db4fc8431db22e7a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"设 $f:(X,\\tau)\\to(Y,\\nu)$ 连续；$G$ 为 $Y$ 上的层，$\\Lambda_YG=(E_G,\\sigma_G,p_G)$。另设 $H$ 为 $Y$ 上的层、$h:G\\to H$ 自然，其茎映射 $h_y:G_y\\to H_y$ 使用 [[14-df-stalk-maps]]。乘积拓扑 $\\tau\\otimes\\sigma_G$ 与子空间拓扑均采用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 的正式构造。分量公式的参数为 $U\\in\\tau$、$t\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(q_{f,G},U)$；$f^*h$ 的分量是从 $(f^*G)(U)$ 到 $(f^*H)(U)$ 的带源靶集合箭头。"},{"id":"14008e4af86a6831","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$、$(Y,\\nu)$ 为拓扑空间；下式对象值取 $U\\in\\tau$，限制函数取 $U,V\\in\\tau$ 且 $V\\subseteq U$，并按 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 包装为集合箭头。连续性谓词采用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]，层谓词采用 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]]。"},{"id":"b00dea11c83b74c1","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"取 $X=\\mathbb R$ 通常拓扑 $\\tau$，$E=(0,\\infty)$ 及子空间拓扑 $\\sigma$；$j:E\\hookrightarrow X$ 为包含映射。使用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 与 [[14-df-covering-spaces-and-locally-constant-sheaves]] 的谓词。"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections|Definition II.6 Étale Maps and Local Sections]]"},{"id":"136d21829e234687","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cont}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Etale}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{Homeo}$ 沿用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]] 中的精确签名。 $\\mathrm{id}_A$ 表示集合或函子 $A$ 的恒等映射。"},{"id":"f84b744ac7e877e9","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":5,"excerpt":"设 $(X,\\tau)$ 为拓扑空间，$P:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为预层；$\\Lambda_XP=(E_P,\\sigma_P,p_P)$ 使用 [[14-df-etale-space-of-germs]]。另设 $\\mathrm{Etale}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)$，$U,V\\in\\tau$、$s\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)$、$t\\in\\mathrm{Sec}(p,V)$，见 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]。"},{"id":"83765a3303e549f5","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[14-df-category]] 的宇宙 $\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$。$\\mathrm{Cont}(p;E,\\sigma;X,\\tau)$，$\\mathrm{Sec}(p,U)$ 采用 [[14-df-etale-maps-and-local-sections]]。$P,Q:\\mathrm{OpenCat}(X,\\tau)\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 为预层，$\\rho^U_{P,V}$ 表示 [[14-df-topological-sheaf]] 中与实际箭头绑定的底层限制函数。"}],"outgoing":["f9af6d7fc5c4f8a0"]}